h her face mask? https://i.imgur.com/WAfgvhg.png https://i.imgur.com/XToJ3n5.png   \nThank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rfetrsx", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IroNff14/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/94cff18a/uploads/origins/ab5b43c4-4b2e-4526-8b67-6f03463bce6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ab2a01c79d08114810949531196e286", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94cff18a/uploads/origins/ab5b43c4-4b2e-4526-8b67-6f03463bce6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ab2a01c79d08114810949531196e286, https://si.imgix.net/94cff18a/uploads/origins/ab5b43c4-4b2e-4526-8b67-6f03463bce6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c36f3bc9f690252e5716008293e0af8e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/94cff18a/uploads/origins/ab5b43c4-4b2e-4526-8b67-6f03463bce6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=446487342bef211c39c973cd53d975b3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello I really like your art! I would like a sketch of my ffxiv character similar to your latest tweet \nhttps://twitter.com/IroNff14/status/1541020880280887296/photo/1 . Pose and Background is up to you.  Reference : https://imgur.com/a/YVoIfmt\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/YVoIfmt", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}